    "### 2.1.2 Experimental design\n",
    "\n",
    "Two intertidal chambers from [ElectricBlue](https://electricblue.eu/intertidal-chamber) were used to simulate tidal cycles and control water temperature during high tide and air temperature during low tide (<a href=\"#fig-design\" class=\"quarto-xref\">Figure 1</a> B,C). Chambers were utilized in parallel with one chamber serving as the control, while the other was used for the experimental treatment."
